@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy - BBF</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Medium" Class="py-4">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h4" Class="mb-2">Privacy Policy</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Color="Color.Secondary" Class="mb-6">Effective date: September 9, 2026</MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">What BBF Is</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        BBF ("Big Bois Federation") is a private, invite-only application operated by Tayler Stoppel
        for a closed group of family and friends. It is not a public product or commercial service,
        and accounts are created by invitation only.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Information We Collect</MudText>
    <MudList T="string" Class="mb-4">
        <MudListItem>Account information: username, email address, and password (stored hashed).</MudListItem>
        <MudListItem>Phone number, if you choose to provide one, used only for optional SMS notifications you opt into.</MudListItem>
        <MudListItem>Financial account data you link through Plaid, used to power budgeting and transaction features.</MudListItem>
        <MudListItem>Content you create in the app, such as budgets, meal plans, chat messages, and uploaded documents.</MudListItem>
    </MudList>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">How We Use Information</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        Information is used solely to operate the features you use within BBF. We do not sell your
        information, and we do not share it with third parties for advertising or marketing purposes.
        Limited data is shared with service providers strictly as needed to deliver a feature you've
        enabled (for example, Plaid for bank account linking, or your mobile carrier for SMS delivery).
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Text Messaging (SMS)</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        If you provide a phone number and opt into SMS notifications, you will receive text messages
        related to features you've enabled (for example, account or activity alerts). Message frequency
        varies based on your usage. Message and data rates may apply. You can opt out at any time by
        replying <b>STOP</b> to any message, or reply <b>HELP</b> for assistance. Carriers are not liable
        for delayed or undelivered messages.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Third-Party Services</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        Bank account linking is provided by Plaid Inc.; their handling of your financial data is
        governed by <MudLink Href="https://plaid.com/legal" Target="_blank">Plaid's own privacy policy</MudLink>.
        AI chat features run on a self-hosted language model and are not transmitted to any external AI provider.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Data Storage &amp; Security</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        BBF is hosted on infrastructure controlled by its operator. Access is restricted to invited members.
        No system is perfectly secure, but reasonable measures are taken to protect your information.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Data Retention &amp; Deletion</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        You may request deletion of your account and associated data at any time by contacting us below.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Children's Privacy</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        BBF is not directed at children under 13 and is not intended for use by them.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Changes to This Policy</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        This policy may be updated from time to time. Continued use of BBF after changes constitutes
        acceptance of the updated policy.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2">Contact</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
        Questions or requests regarding this policy can be sent to
        <MudLink Href="mailto:taylerstoppel@outlook.com">taylerstoppel@outlook.com</MudLink>.
    </MudText>
</MudContainer>
